  "utterances": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "speaker": "JUDGE ANTONETTI",
      "role": "judge",
      "type": "statement",
      "text": "[Interpretation] Mr. Registrar, will you please call the case."
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "speaker": "THE REGISTRAR",
      "role": "registrar",
      "type": "statement",
      "text": "Your Honours, case number IT-01-47-T, the Prosecutor versus Enver Hadzihasanovic and Amir Kubura."
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "speaker": "JUDGE ANTONETTI",
      "role": "judge",
      "type": "statement",
      "text": "[Interpretation] Thank you, Mr. Registrar. Can we have the appearances for the Prosecution, please."
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "speaker": "MR. MUNDIS",
      "role": "counsel",
      "type": "statement",
      "text": "Good morning, Mr. President, Your Honours, Counsel, and everyone in and around the courtroom. For the Prosecution, Tecla Henry-Benjamin, Daryl Mundis, and the case manager, Andres Vatter."
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "speaker": "JUDGE ANTONETTI",
      "role": "judge",
      "type": "statement",
      "text": "[Interpretation] And the appearances for the Defence, please."
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "speaker": "MS. RESIDOVIC",
      "role": "counsel",
      "type": "statement",
      "text": "[Interpretation] Good morning, Mr. President. Good morning, Your Honours. On behalf of General Enver Hadzihasanovic, Edina Residovic, lead counsel; and Stephane Bourgon, co-counsel. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "speaker": "MR. IBRISIMOVIC",
      "role": "counsel",
      "type": "statement",
      "text": "[Interpretation] Good morning, Your Honours. On behalf of Mr. Kubura, Rodney Dixon, Fahrudin Ibrisimovic, and Nermin Mulalic, legal assistant."
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "speaker": "JUDGE ANTONETTI",
      "role": "judge",
      "type": "statement",
      "text": "[Microphone not activated]"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "speaker": "THE INTERPRETER",
      "role": "interpreter",
      "type": "statement",
      "text": "Microphone, please, Mr. President."
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "speaker": "JUDGE ANTONETTI",
      "role": "judge",
      "type": "statement",
      "text": "[Interpretation] I was saying that we are in open session. The Chamber bids good morning to all those present, the representatives of the Prosecution, Defence counsel, the accused and all the staff of this courtroom, having in mind in particular the interpreters. Today we need to continue the hearing of a witness, but it is my understanding that the Prosecution wishes to address two points, so in open session I give the floor to Mr. Mundis."
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "speaker": "MR. MUNDIS",
      "role": "counsel",
      "type": "statement",
      "text": "Thank you, Mr. President. I would respectfully request that we go into private session."
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "speaker": "JUDGE ANTONETTI",
      "role": "judge",
      "type": "statement",
      "text": "[Interpretation] Yes, let us go into private session."
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "speaker": "JUDGE ANTONETTI",
      "role": "judge",
      "type": "statement",
      "text": "Blank page inserted to ensure pagination corresponds between the French and English transcripts."
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "speaker": "JUDGE ANTONETTI",
      "role": "judge",
      "type": "statement",
      "text": "to be reconvened on Wednesday, the 16th day of June, 2004, at 9.00 a.m."
    }
  ],
